msgstr "Keep peasants working near the church: every ten seconds it baptizes one of them."

msgid "Keep the batteries firing; do not let the garrison spike more than half the bombards"
msgstr "Keep the batteries firing; do not let the garrison spike more than half the bombards"

msgid "Keep the camp up the water. And set up an infirmary, even if it is of wagons."
msgstr "Keep the camp up the water. And set up an infirmary, even if it is of wagons."

msgid "Keep watching"
msgstr "Keep watching"

msgid "Keep your units on the place of power with no enemies near to take it. Then peasants can lay an alka on it."
msgstr "Keep your units on the place of power with no enemies near to take it. Then peasants can lay an alka on it."

msgid "King! The Master sends you a sword, if you are short of your own. And if you are cramped, we will draw back and give you the field."
msgstr "King! The Master sends you a sword, if you are short of your own. And if you are cramped, we will draw back and give you the field."

msgid "King's herald"
msgstr "King's herald"

msgid "King's messenger"
msgstr "King's messenger"

msgid "Kobylański and Prince Michael strike the column's head beyond the stream. The middle ford is yours."
msgstr "Kobylański and Prince Michael strike the column's head beyond the stream. The middle ford is yours."

