msgstr "Ladders at the walls: %d"

msgid "Ladders! Keep men right behind the wall where a ladder stands: they push it off and the climber falls. Townsmen now take up arms. The guns are aimed at the gate: they hardly harm the walls."
msgstr "Ladders! Keep men right behind the wall where a ladder stands: they push it off and the climber falls. Townsmen now take up arms. The guns are aimed at the gate: they hardly harm the walls."

msgid "Lake Žirnajai south of Vilkomir. 30 August to 1 September 1435."
msgstr "Lake Žirnajai south of Vilkomir. 30 August to 1 September 1435."

