msgstr "Large"

msgid "Later they said that Chelyadnin knew of the crossing and did not hinder it on purpose, so as to beat us all at once. Whether that is so I do not know. I know that by dawn we were on that bank, and the Dnieper was at our backs."
msgstr "Later they said that Chelyadnin knew of the crossing and did not hinder it on purpose, so as to beat us all at once. Whether that is so I do not know. I know that by dawn we were on that bank, and the Dnieper was at our backs."

msgid "Lay both bridges without raising the alarm on the far bank"
msgstr "Lay both bridges without raising the alarm on the far bank"

msgid "Lead Gintaut's khorugv through the whole battle: from the first charge at the Order's left wing to the storming of the wagenburg. Keep the khorugv's banner up and do not leave the Smolensk banners alone."
msgstr "Lead Gintaut's khorugv through the whole battle: from the first charge at the Order's left wing to the storming of the wagenburg. Keep the khorugv's banner up and do not leave the Smolensk banners alone."

msgid "Lead forest archers past the Order's watch to the spring"
msgstr "Lead forest archers past the Order's watch to the spring"

msgid "Lead the Left Hand onto the hidden guns with a false retreat"
msgstr "Lead the Left Hand onto the hidden guns with a false retreat"

msgid "Lead the council's envoys from the ford to the Medininkai road"
msgstr "Lead the council's envoys from the ford to the Medininkai road"

msgid "Lead the delegation's cart along the trail to the sea in the north"
msgstr "Lead the delegation's cart along the trail to the sea in the north"

msgid "Lead the envoys round the grove"
msgstr "Lead the envoys round the grove"

msgid "Lead the horses (V) to go quietly at a walk; then the horses rest too. At a trot they tire, and a tired horse only walks. A full meter of suspicion raises the alarm."
msgstr "Lead the horses (V) to go quietly at a walk; then the horses rest too. At a trot they tire, and a tired horse only walks. A full meter of suspicion raises the alarm."

msgid "Lead the horses / mount"
msgstr "Lead the horses / mount"

msgid "Leave the border camp at night without raising the alarm, get past the zaseka, wait out the day in the forest and reach the border ford. There Andrei Gintovt must hold the ford until the prince is across."
msgstr "Leave the border camp at night without raising the alarm, get past the zaseka, wait out the day in the forest and reach the border ford. There Andrei Gintovt must hold the ford until the prince is across."

msgid "Leave the border camp without raising the alarm"
msgstr "Leave the border camp without raising the alarm"

msgid "Leave the kaftan. I will leave in what I came in."
msgstr "Leave the kaftan. I will leave in what I came in."

msgid "Left (you)"
msgstr "Left (you)"

msgid "Left click on anything else (enemy, deposit, forest) shows it below."
msgstr "Left click on anything else (enemy, deposit, forest) shows it below."

