msgstr "Left click selects; drag a box to select several."

msgid "Let the townsmen break them up for firewood. They will come in useful in winter."
msgstr "Let the townsmen break them up for firewood. They will come in useful in winter."

msgid "Let them come and see what Samogitian faith is worth."
msgstr "Let them come and see what Samogitian faith is worth."

msgid "Let them roast. My horse is borrowed, I am in no hurry."
msgstr "Let them roast. My horse is borrowed, I am in no hurry."

msgid "Let them sit. We will come again."
msgstr "Let them sit. We will come again."

msgid "Let them. By the time they come back the bridges must stand."
msgstr "Let them. By the time they come back the bridges must stand."

