msgstr "Live through the plague: do not let it reach its limit"

msgid "Load game"
msgstr "Load game"

msgid "Look, on the right! The Lithuanians!"
msgstr "Look, on the right! The Lithuanians!"

msgid "Lord Gintaut, the Germans are in our grove. They are building a house for their god, and our oaks are going for logs."
msgstr "Lord Gintaut, the Germans are in our grove. They are building a house for their god, and our oaks are going for logs."

msgid "Lord Gintovt, your banner stands closest to the water. Nobody crosses to that side without my word. And nobody comes over from there either."
msgstr "Lord Gintovt, your banner stands closest to the water. Nobody crosses to that side without my word. And nobody comes over from there either."

msgid "Lord of the council"
msgstr "Lord of the council"

msgid "Lord standard-bearer! Horses in the forest. Many of them, saddled."
msgstr "Lord standard-bearer! Horses in the forest. Many of them, saddled."

msgid "Lord standard-bearer, over there they sing the same song we sing at harvest."
msgstr "Lord standard-bearer, over there they sing the same song we sing at harvest."

msgid "Lord standard-bearer, they stand on this side of the Trosna, before the bridge. Horse with bows, a regiment of them."
msgstr "Lord standard-bearer, they stand on this side of the Trosna, before the bridge. Horse with bows, a regiment of them."

msgid "Lord standard-bearer. You go together. And you come back together."
msgstr "Lord standard-bearer. You go together. And you come back together."

msgid "Lord… that is the lady mother's belt. That is Lord Jurij."
msgstr "Lord… that is the lady mother's belt. That is Lord Jurij."

