msgid "Malbork (Marienburg) on the Nogat, Prussia. 25 July – 19 September 1410."
msgstr "Malbork (Marienburg) on the Nogat, Prussia. 25 July – 19 September 1410."

msgid "Many hands raised the banner, and whose, nobody wrote down. Pan Jan insisted that one of them was his great-grandfather's. And of the other, in the red sleeve, his family did not like to speak."
msgstr "Many hands raised the banner, and whose, nobody wrote down. Pan Jan insisted that one of them was his great-grandfather's. And of the other, in the red sleeve, his family did not like to speak."

msgid "Many of them know it, my lord. In Lithuanian."
msgstr "Many of them know it, my lord. In Lithuanian."

msgid "Meet them at the kurgan. Surround them, don't cut them down: let them lay down their arms."
msgstr "Meet them at the kurgan. Surround them, don't cut them down: let them lay down their arms."

msgid "Men are drowning in the ford! Send them across two at a time."
msgstr "Men are drowning in the ford! Send them across two at a time."

msgid "Men in short jackets run out of a side gate, without armour, with axes and boathooks. They roar a song and run straight at the guns."
msgstr "Men in short jackets run out of a side gate, without armour, with axes and boathooks. They roar a song and run straight at the guns."

